// relief: how far ahead of the eye the rear sight sits when aimed, in metres. A weapon tuned in game (g_ads_tune, the numpad)
// carries its own relief, view-model tangent and zoom over its class's.
// in / out: seconds to come up to the eye and to go back down.
// zoom: magnification through the sights. viewModelTan: the arms' and weapon's half-angle tangent there (hip: 0.577).
// spread / recoil / move / sway: what the full aim makes of the hip's cone, kick, speed and sway.
// steady: how much of the original clip's own motion the aim holds still. kick: a shot's push on the weapon at the hip
// (metres and degrees); aimedKick: what aiming makes of it. mount: whether it braces on ledges and tables.
